            </note>
            <note corresp="#d37-f3" n="3" xml:id="d37-f3-content">
                <p>The Summary of Conclusions of this meeting indicate that the Working Group
                    discussed covert action proposals. (National Security Council, Carter
                    Intelligence Files, Box 20, SCC Special
                    Activities Working Group 1977)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
